---
// Banda promocional de la plantilla CRM gratuita (lead magnet).
---

<section class="py-16 bg-lightAccent relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,rgba(255,255,255,0.08)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,rgba(255,255,255,0.08)_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:48px_48px] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid md:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] gap-8 items-center">
    <div>
      <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-white text-lightAccent text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest rounded mb-4">Descarga gratuita</span>
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl md:text-5xl font-black uppercase text-white leading-[0.95] mb-4">Plantilla CRM gratis para Excel y Google Sheets</h2>
      <p class="text-white/85 text-lg max-w-2xl font-medium">Clientes, oportunidades, seguimientos y un panel de ventas automático. Lista para usar en 5 minutos, sin registrarte en ningún programa.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/plantilla-crm-gratis/" class="group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-5 bg-white text-gray-900 font-black text-base uppercase tracking-widest rounded-sm hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all shadow-[6px_6px_0_0_rgba(0,0,0,0.25)] whitespace-nowrap">
      <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-lightAccent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3v12m0 0-4-4m4 4 4-4M4 17v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2"/></svg>
      Descargar gratis
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
